Integration changes (2026-10-28): the local adapter uses strict streamed weight
loading, inference-only VAE components, component CPU/GPU offload, bounded
attention queries and CPU marching cubes. It simplifies the inferred geometry
and projects the supplied photograph onto the visible front; hidden surfaces
use estimated coating colors. The optional Hunyuan Paint model is not included.
Upstream source files and weights are not modified by this adapter.

